{"product_id":"zom-b-underground","title":"ZOM-B Underground","description":"\u003cp\u003eWaking up in a military complex, months after zombies attacked school, B has no memory of the last few months. Life in the UK has turned tough since the outbreak, and B is woven into life- and battle- in the new military regime quickly. But as B learns more about the zombies held in the complex and the scientists keeping them captive, unease settles in. Why exactly was B saved? And is there anyone left in the world to trust?\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 130 x 197\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Darren Shan\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780857077585\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 218\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45195445764249,"sku":"7RC9780857077585","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/67c883010c413_ZOM-B_20Underground_20Darren_20Shan.webp?v=1752084576","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/zom-b-underground","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}